able>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::numpunct_byname::numpunct_byname\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::numpunct_byname::</span>numpunct_byname</h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> numpunct_byname<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> name, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> refs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> numpunct_byname<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> name, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> refs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a new <code>std::numpunct_byname</code> facet for a locale with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">name</span></code>. \n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">refs</span></code> is used for resource management: if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">refs <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>, the implementation destroys the facet, when the last <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">std::locale</a></span> object holding it is destroyed. Otherwise, the object is not destroyed.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> name\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the name of the locale\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> refs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the number of references that link to the facet\n</td></tr></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::numpunct_byname::.7Enumpunct_byname\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::numpunct_byname::</span>~numpunct_byname </h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>~numpunct_byname<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destroys the facet.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::numpunct\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>numpunct</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Nested_types_2\">Nested types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>char_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>CharT</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>string_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Data_members\">Data members</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member\n</td>\n<td> Description\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-dsc-small\"><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/id\">std::locale::id</a></span></span> <code>id</code> <span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span>\n</td>\n<td> the identifier of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet#Facet_class\">facet</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions_2\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/decimal_point\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>decimal_point</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_decimal_point</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/thousands_sep\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>thousands_sep</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_thousands_sep</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/grouping\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>grouping</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_grouping</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/truefalsename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>truename</span><span>falsename</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_truename</code> or <code>do_falsename</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Protected_member_functions\">Protected member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/decimal_point\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_decimal_point</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the character to use as decimal point <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/thousands_sep\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_thousands_sep</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the character to use as thousands separator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/grouping\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_grouping</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the numbers of digits between each pair of thousands separators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/truefalsename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_truename</span><span>do_falsename</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the string to use as the name of the boolean <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>This example demonstrates how to apply numeric punctuation rules of another language without changing the rest of the locale.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> number <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1000.25</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"default locale: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> number <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">getloc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n                                 new std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">numpunct_byname</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"ru_RU.UTF8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1776\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wcout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"default locale with russian numpunct: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> number <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> L<span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>default locale: 1000.25\ndefault locale with russian numpunct: 1 000,25</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>numpunct</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  defines numeric punctuation rules <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Specializations","id":"Specializations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Nested types","id":"Nested_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":2,"text":"std::numpunct_byname::numpunct_byname","id":"std::numpunct_byname::numpunct_byname"},{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":2,"text":"std::numpunct_byname::~numpunct_byname","id":"std::numpunct_byname::.7Enumpunct_byname"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::numpunct","id":"Inherited_from_std::numpunct"},{"depth":3,"text":"Nested types","id":"Nested_types_2"},{"depth":3,"text":"Data members","id":"Data_members"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions_2"},{"depth":3,"text":"Protected member functions","id":"Protected_member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"}]